    <string name="overlay_help">A square PNG with a transparent background and centre: a frame, highlights or decoration. Preferably 192 × 192 px; other sizes are resized to 192 × 192 without cropping. This is the icon_border.png top layer, not a clipping mask. Transparent areas reveal the icon; opaque areas cover it. HONOR applies it to icons without replacements. In All mode, Icon Foundry also draws it onto pack and file icons during export. A copy is saved in the template.</string>
    <string name="overlay_invalid">Choose a square PNG with visible artwork and fully transparent areas. Do not use an opaque image or an empty file.</string>
