    <string name="apps">App icons</string>
    <string name="apps_help">Tap an app to replace its icon. The current source pack opens first; other packs load when selected. Resource references pick up pack updates; replace assignments if a pack or resource is removed. File icons are stored in the template. Assignments and exclusions apply in both export modes.</string>
