    <string name="folder_background">Remove grey stacked-folder background</string>
    <string name="folder_background_help">Apply the full theme, not just icons, to remove the stacked-folder background. Without your own wallpaper, HONOR may set a fallback. Also removes the unknown-shortcut background in night mode.</string>
    <string name="fallback_shape_help">The icon_mask.png mask clips system icons without replacements, including future apps. Its size matches the typical visible pack icon, excluding transparent padding and shadows. Pack icons are unchanged; No mask keeps their original shape.</string>
